# A proper Thompson-style epsilon-NFA for (a|b)*.
#   inner union (a|b):  U branches by epsilon to the 'a' path and the 'b' path,
#                        both rejoin at W by epsilon
#   outer star:          I -eps-> U (enter the loop) and I -eps-> F (zero times);
#                        W -eps-> U (loop back)      and W -eps-> F (exit)
states: I U A1 A2 B1 B2 W F
alphabet: a b
start: I
accept: F
I  epsilon U
I  epsilon F
U  epsilon A1
U  epsilon B1
A1 a A2
B1 b B2
A2 epsilon W
B2 epsilon W
W  epsilon U
W  epsilon F
